{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49426","headline":"临江仙 二 · 牛希济","name":"临江仙 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谢家仙观寄云岑，岩萝拂地成阴。\n洞房不闭白云深。\n当时丹竈，一粒化黄金。\n石壁霞衣犹半挂，松风长似鸣琴。\n时闻唳鹤起前林。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"牛希济","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49426.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49426","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}